FWIW, be aware that ORBS occasionally lists hosts which are not relays.
They generally come back as 127.0.0.4, which means that they did something
that pissed off the ORBS admins.  That said, this one looks to have been
open.

Perhaps someone should suggest using the RBL and/or RSS (the MAPS-run
relay list, very nice) as input filters on the NetBSD mailing lists?

