On Fri, 25 Feb 2000, Wilko Bulte wrote:

=> On Fri, Feb 25, 2000 at 02:16:46AM -0500, Geoff Adams wrote:
=> > On 2-24-2000 8:36 PM, Hal Murray at murray@pa.dec.com wrote:
